  "summary": "I am a Lead Software Engineer specializing in distributed systems, parser infrastructure, and high‑reliability backend platforms. I operate as a technical leader who brings structure, clarity, and stability to complex systems; especially during periods of organizational transition.\n\nMy work centers on building scalable internal tools, improving system performance, and reducing operational risk across teams. I’m known for owning critical components end‑to‑end, driving architectural decisions, and mentoring engineers to raise the overall technical bar.\n\nI thrive in environments where reliability, precision, and long‑term thinking matter. My approach blends hands‑on engineering with calm, senior‑level leadership that keeps teams aligned and systems stable.",
